        "date": "2026-11-16T21:09:06Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): hold crossing law on OffsetRings and Waterline pockets\n\nEnforce post_crossing_free in emit_pocket_passes whenever\nhold_crossings is set or the strategy fits pass arcs (Adaptive,\nOffsetRings, or Waterline), and count non-Adaptive fitted arcs in\nproof.arcs. Prevents Clipper2 micron-quantized circle vertices from\nleaving crossing arc chord brackets when 2D Adaptive falls back to\nOffsetRings on STEP models such as fig8.step.\n\nFixes #2240",
